SUMMARY:Make this week's Couple Things videos
DESCRIPTION:For each Couple Things Short 1 to 8 (shorts\\couple-things\\):
  drag it onto make-video.bat\, then onto make-social.bat. Also make-socia
 l.bat for shorts\\standalone\\uploaded\\4-short-the-compliment.txt and sh
 orts\\episode-shorts\\uploaded\\ep2-1-very-local-wind.txt (Instagram file
 s only\; their videos are made already). Or make each one the night befor
 e it is scheduled. First run git pull origin Improvment.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Make this week's Couple Things videos
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
