SUMMARY:Upload night: Episode 8 + CT1
DESCRIPTION:YOUTUBE - publish now: Episode 8\, The Voice in the Dark\; Cou
 ple Things 1: How We Met (Part 1).\nYOUTUBE - schedule: ep5-2 The Upside-
 Down Map -> Tue 8:00 AM\; Couple Things 2: Our First Date (Part 2) -> Tue
  1:00 PM.\nEvery Couple Things Short: add it to the "Ren & Yuki: Couple T
 hings" playlist (Details page).\nINSTAGRAM - post now: Reel: Couple Thing
 s 1: How We Met (Part 1) - pin it\; Carousel: Meet Ren & Yuki (instagram\
 \profile-kit\\meet-us-1 to 4.jpg\, caption in INSTAGRAM-PROFILE.md) - pin
  it\; Share the Reel to your Story\, then make the "Our Story" Highlight 
 (cover highlight-our-story.jpg).\nINSTAGRAM - schedule: Reel: Couple Thin
 gs 2: Our First Date (Part 2) -> Tue 7:00 PM.\nInstagram Reel: share the 
 video\, cover = reel-cover.jpg (Edit cover > Add from camera roll)\, capt
 ion from instagram.txt (both in videos\\<story>\\instagram\\). To schedul
 e: Advanced settings > Schedule (or post it at that time).\nAfter posting
 : move each YouTube story file into its uploaded folder (Couple Things st
 ay where they are)\, and in YouTube Studio set "Related video" for every 
 episode Short (UPLOAD-SCHEDULE.md).
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Upload night: Episode 8 + CT1
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
